# niri ships CachyOS defaults: config.kdl is just a list of includes and cfg/
# holds the modules it pulls in. Only user.kdl is ours, so keep the defaults
# unmanaged — tracking config.kdl without cfg/ would apply a config whose
# includes do not exist on a fresh machine.
